<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Schynige Platte–Faulhorn–First — Schynige Platte–Faulhorn summit–First</name><desc>Walk from Schynige Platte along the Loucherhorn flank and through Männdlenen to the Faulhorn summit, then descend past Bachalpsee to First. This long exposed mountain traverse needs stable snow-free weather and enough time to reach the last lift.

